WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.800
[A completion chime stretches into a soft inward sweep]

00:02.800 --> 00:05.200
[Electronic rhythm and passing event clicks]

00:05.200 --> 00:06.400
[Low impact; the rhythm falls away at a failing test]

00:06.400 --> 00:08.800
[Clicks follow the path back to an earlier edit]

00:08.800 --> 00:14.700
[Quiet electronic bed; clicks mark individual code changes]

00:14.700 --> 00:16.500
[A soft sweep, then a warm confirmation chord as tests pass]

00:16.500 --> 00:21.000
[Two source confirmations, followed by a verification tone]

00:21.000 --> 00:25.200
[A soft sweep opens the product; light rhythm returns]

00:25.200 --> 00:30.000
[The sound resolves as the dot becomes a play button]
